const n='---\ntitle: "Qingpu 用户设置"\ndescription: "Qingpu 主题私有的用户设置配置桶，用于铺货工作台"\n---\n\n# Qingpu 用户设置 API\n\n本模块为 `qingpu` 主题提供了一套私有 PostgreSQL 用户设置配置桶。它按用户维度把工作台偏好统一收口到 `qingpu_settings` 表中，而不是继续往 APayShop 全局 `settings` 表里追加零散键值。\n\n## 初始化步骤\n\n1. 配置 `QINGPU_DATABASE_URL`，或者直接复用 `DATABASE_URL`。\n2. 执行 `app/themes/qingpu/database/settings.sql` 中的建表 SQL。\n3. 在铺货工作台通过 `/api/qingpu/listing/settings` 读写配置。\n\n## 存储约定\n\n- 配置按 `user_id` 隔离。\n- 根 JSON 文档保存在 `qingpu_settings.settings` 中。\n- 当前的模型偏好保存在 `listing.modelSettings` 下。\n- 后续如果增加采集、发布或工作流相关偏好，也继续往同一个 JSON 配置桶里扩展，不再拆新的零散配置表。\n\n---\n\n## 1. 获取铺货模型设置\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/listing/settings`\n- **请求方法**: `GET`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户或 Bearer 租户 Key\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "persisted": true,\n  "data": {\n    "generalModelApiKey": "sk-live-xxxx",\n    "generalModelBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",\n    "generalModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "imageModelName": "gpt-image-1",\n    "imageGenSize": "1008x1344",\n    "imageGenQuality": "medium",\n    "imageProviderProfiles": [\n      {\n        "id": "imgp_demo",\n        "name": "高清竖图",\n        "model": "gpt-image-1",\n        "size": "1024x1536",\n        "quality": "high"\n      }\n    ],\n    "activeImageProfileId": "imgp_demo",\n    "videoModelName": "veo-3-fast",\n    "videoGenQuality": "medium",\n    "translationModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "offerIdPrefix": "QP",\n    "exchangeRate": 12.5,\n    "commissionRate": 0.15,\n    "freightCny": 5,\n    "domesticFeeCny": 2,\n    "profitRate": 0.2,\n    "frontDiscountRate": 0,\n    "priceRoundRule": "to9",\n    "storageFeeRub": 0,\n    "storageMonths": 1,\n    "adBudgetRub": 0,\n    "adRate": 0,\n    "otherRate": 0.03,\n    "returnRate": 0.05,\n    "translationGlossary": [\n      { "source": "收纳盒", "target": "коробка для хранения" },\n      { "source": "加厚", "target": "утолщенный" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- `persisted=true` 表示当前用户已经在云端保存过这份配置。\n- `persisted=false` 表示当前接口返回的是服务端默认值，云端还没有真实保存记录。\n\n---\n\n## 2. 保存铺货模型设置\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/listing/settings`\n- **请求方法**: `POST`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户或 Bearer 租户 Key\n\n### 请求体\n\n```json\n{\n  "generalModelApiKey": "sk-live-xxxx",\n  "generalModelBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",\n  "generalModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n  "imageModelName": "gpt-image-1",\n  "imageGenSize": "1008x1344",\n  "imageGenQuality": "high",\n  "imageProviderProfiles": [\n    {\n      "id": "imgp_demo",\n      "name": "高清竖图",\n      "model": "gpt-image-1",\n      "size": "1024x1536",\n      "quality": "high"\n    }\n  ],\n  "activeImageProfileId": "imgp_demo",\n  "videoModelName": "veo-3-fast",\n  "videoGenQuality": "medium",\n  "translationModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n  "offerIdPrefix": "QP",\n  "exchangeRate": 12.5,\n  "commissionRate": 0.15,\n  "freightCny": 5,\n  "domesticFeeCny": 2,\n  "profitRate": 0.2,\n  "frontDiscountRate": 0,\n  "priceRoundRule": "to9",\n  "storageFeeRub": 0,\n  "storageMonths": 1,\n  "adBudgetRub": 0,\n  "adRate": 0,\n  "otherRate": 0.03,\n  "returnRate": 0.05,\n  "translationGlossary": [\n    { "source": "收纳盒", "target": "коробка для хранения" },\n    { "source": "加厚", "target": "утолщенный" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Listing model settings saved successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "generalModelApiKey": "sk-live-xxxx",\n    "generalModelBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",\n    "generalModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "imageModelName": "gpt-image-1",\n    "imageGenSize": "1008x1344",\n    "imageGenQuality": "high",\n    "imageProviderProfiles": [\n      {\n        "id": "imgp_demo",\n        "name": "高清竖图",\n        "model": "gpt-image-1",\n        "size": "1024x1536",\n        "quality": "high"\n      }\n    ],\n    "activeImageProfileId": "imgp_demo",\n    "videoModelName": "veo-3-fast",\n    "videoGenQuality": "medium",\n    "translationModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "offerIdPrefix": "QP",\n    "exchangeRate": 12.5,\n    "commissionRate": 0.15,\n    "freightCny": 5,\n    "domesticFeeCny": 2,\n    "profitRate": 0.2,\n    "frontDiscountRate": 0,\n    "priceRoundRule": "to9",\n    "storageFeeRub": 0,\n    "storageMonths": 1,\n    "adBudgetRub": 0,\n    "adRate": 0,\n    "otherRate": 0.03,\n    "returnRate": 0.05,\n    "translationGlossary": [\n      { "source": "收纳盒", "target": "коробка для хранения" },\n      { "source": "加厚", "target": "утолщенный" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 说明\n\n- `imageGenSize` 支持: `auto`、`1008x1344`、`1024x1536`、`768x1024`、`1024x1024`、`1536x1024`\n- `imageGenQuality` 与 `videoGenQuality` 支持: `auto`、`low`、`medium`、`high`\n- `imageProviderProfiles` 为可选字段，用于保存可复用的图片方案；`activeImageProfileId` 指向当前启用的方案\n- `offerIdPrefix`、`exchangeRate`、`commissionRate` 等字段为铺货工作台默认定价参数，供 Dash 与官网设置页共用\n- `translationGlossary` 为用户手工维护的固定术语表；它与本地运行期 `translationMemory` 缓存分开存储\n- 模型名称允许留空，表示后续工作流可回退到通用模型或系统默认模型\n';export{n as default};
